* Find maximum in array — simple loop
* Array of 10 numbers at address 100, result at address 110
N       EQU     10          * array length
ARR     EQU     100         * array base
RESULT  EQU     110         * result address
        ORIG    ARR
        CON     14
        CON     3
        CON     99
        CON     27
        CON     51
        CON     8
        CON     72
        CON     45
        CON     6
        CON     31
        ORIG    3000
START   LDA     ARR         * rA = arr[0] (initial max)
        ENT1    1           * i = 1
LOOP    CMPA    ARR,1       * max vs arr[i]
        JGE     NEXT        * if max >= arr[i], skip
        LDA     ARR,1       * max = arr[i]
NEXT    INC1    1           * i++
        CMP1    =N=         * i < N?
        JL      LOOP
        STA     RESULT      * store max
        HLT
        END     START
